      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/.pi-extension/imm-canary-enroll.ts: Enrollment only emits attention events; it never directly presents the shared Task Rail, so when the Work extension is absent or has no railContext before the first input/session_start, the validated enrollment/waiver UI opens without the required task-level Rail. Verify an enrollment-only extension instance calls setWidget with the shared key at preparation/attention and clears it on shutdown while preserving outcomes."
    },
    {
      "id": "review-b9f98458ee70-2-review-2",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-work-interaction-surface",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/.pi-extension/pi-canary-interaction.ts: terminalRailVisible is module-global rather than scoped per ExtensionContext/session, so a terminal result in one host instance can cause input or shutdown in another instance to clear the wrong Rail and lose terminal-until-next-input semantics. Verify two concurrent extension contexts retain and clear their terminal Rails independently."
    }
